                                                "sense_id": "94288d48-841f-359b-99ad-3115484a1054",
                                                "text": "Whereas the liar is at least mindful of the truth (if only to avoid it), the “bullshitter,” Professor Frankfurt wrote, is distinguished by his complete indifference to how things are."
                                            }
